// # str — String Primitives
//
// Logline: The OoStr core (retain, release, alloc, concat), the ASCII + FNV-1a interning pool, the dedicated 0..8191 integer interning, the token-line builder, and the query operations (eq, contains, starts_with, ends_with, index_of, to_uppercase).
//
// Setup: str.c is the OoStr core; str_intern.c is the interning pool; str_from_int.c is the integer interning; str_tok.c is the token-line builder (used by oodac for error messages); str_ops.c is the query operations.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Read str.c — retain, release, alloc_payload, lit, concat, concat_list.
//   2. Read str_intern.c — ASCII interning + FNV-1a hash interning.
//   3. Read str_from_int.c — 0..8191 integer interning.
//   4. Read str_tok.c — token-line builder for error messages.
//   5. Read str_ops.c — eq, contains, starts_with, ends_with, index_of.
//
// ──▓▓ str ANCHOR ──▓▓──
// :: the only "string" type in the runtime ::
